  "rationale": "These scenarios add contract partitions not directly covered by the current suite or prior witnesses: empty-string tenant/key, null and unknown sku validation; unknown op plus missing required field without side effects; failed-then-retried reservation after an insufficient attempt; exact release not_found behavior for foreign-case tenant and foreign-case key; tuple identity distinctions using separators/shared prefixes for idempotency; and post-release stock restoration scoped to the original sku with repeated-release stock checks to expose silent double-restoration.",
